{"id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves.md","title":"Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves","display":"Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","aliases":["14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves"],"display":"Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.1, printed 67–68; DjVu 39–40","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.1, printed 67–68; DjVu 39–40"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span>，值及限制约定见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\tau\">\\(W\\in\\tau\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。</p>\n<p>另设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,Q)\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,Q)\\)</span>，自然变换按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 的三元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0,P_1\">\\(P_0,P_1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_0,Q_1\">\\(Q_0,Q_1\\)</span> 是函子的两个分量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=U\\Rightarrow\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;\\left((\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\rho^U_{P,A}(s)=\\rho^U_{P,A}(t))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=U\\Rightarrow\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;\\left((\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\rho^U_{P,A}(s)=\\rho^U_{P,A}(t))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_W=\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq W\\},\\qquad(P|_W)(U)=P(U),\\qquad\\rho^U_{P|_W,V}=\\rho^U_{P,V}\\quad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_W=\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq W\\},\\qquad(P|_W)(U)=P(U),\\qquad\\rho^U_{P|_W,V}=\\rho^U_{P,V}\\quad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P|_W,W,\\tau_W)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P|_W,W,\\tau_W)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P|_W:=\\bigl(P_0|_{\\tau_W},\\ P_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(W,\\tau_W))}\\bigr),\\qquad h|_W:=\\bigl(P|_W,Q|_W,(h_U)_{U\\in\\tau_W}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P|_W:=\\bigl(P_0|_{\\tau_W},\\ P_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(W,\\tau_W))}\\bigr),\\qquad h|_W:=\\bigl(P|_W,Q|_W,(h_U)_{U\\in\\tau_W}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>分离性只保留唯一拼接，不断言相容局部数据存在拼接。限制到开子空间不改变其中开集的拓扑与限制映射，故层条件直接继承。空开集的空覆盖迫使分离预层在空集上的值至多一个元素；层则恰有一个。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$，值及限制约定见 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]]；$W\\in\\tau$。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"另设 $Q$ 为 $X$ 上预层，$h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,Q)$，自然变换按 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 的三元组编码；$P_0,P_1$ 和 $Q_0,Q_1$ 是函子的两个分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"P_0,P_1","display":false},{"tex":"Q_0,Q_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\tau\\;\\left(\\bigcup\\mathcal A=U\\Rightarrow\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;\\left((\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\rho^U_{P,A}(s)=\\rho^U_{P,A}(t))\\Rightarrow s=t\\right)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau_W=\\{U\\in\\tau:U\\subseteq W\\},\\qquad(P|_W)(U)=P(U),\\qquad\\rho^U_{P|_W,V}=\\rho^U_{P,V}\\quad(V\\subseteq U\\in\\tau_W).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P|_W,W,\\tau_W)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"P|_W:=\\bigl(P_0|_{\\tau_W},\\ P_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathrm{OpenCat}(W,\\tau_W))}\\bigr),\\qquad h|_W:=\\bigl(P|_W,Q|_W,(h_U)_{U\\in\\tau_W}\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2158,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves|Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves]]"},{"id":"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]"},{"id":"d1e530bf0272a409","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves|Definition II.1 Restriction and Separated Presheaves]]"},{"id":"68e604d61e80b1fc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$I\\in\\mathcal U$、$(W_i)_{i\\in I}\\in\\tau^I$ 且 $\\bigcup_{i\\in I}W_i=X$，$F_i$ 是 $(W_i,\\tau|_{W_i})$ 上的层。对每个 $i,j\\in I$ 给定自然同构 $\\theta_{ij}:F_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j}\\to F_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j}$，并假设 $\\forall i\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ii}=\\mathrm{id}_{F_i})$ 及 $\\forall i,j,k\\in I\\ ((\\theta_{jk}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})\\circ(\\theta_{ij}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})=\\theta_{ik}|_{W_i\\cap W_j\\cap W_k})$。限制、自然变换使用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 的签名。另设 $H$ 为 $X$ 上的层，$\\psi_i:H|_{W_i}\\xrightarrow{\\sim}F_i$，满足 $\\forall i,j\\in I\\ (\\theta_{ij}\\circ(\\psi_i|_{W_i\\cap W_j})=\\psi_j|_{W_i\\cap W_j})$。以下对象公式取 $U\\in\\tau$，限制公式取 $U,V\\in\\tau$ 且 $V\\subseteq U$；$\\phi_{i,V}$ 的参数满足 $i\\in I$、$V\\in\\tau$、$V\\subseteq W_i$。"},{"id":"3812e440af103029","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $P$ 为 $X$ 上的预层；$a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)$。符号见 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]、[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]；分离性见 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]。"}],"outgoing":["83765a3303e549f5","f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}